#### Scenario: Compensation Failure Requiring Manual Review

```text
1. Member requests plan change from PlanA to PlanB
2. Member Service updates to PlanB → publishes PlanChangeRequested event
3. Plan Service assigns PlanB → publishes PlanAssigned event
4. Benefits Service calculates PlanB benefits → publishes BenefitsCalculated event
5. Card Service generates PlanB ID card → FAILURE (card service down)
6. Card Service publishes CardGenerationFailed event
7. COMPENSATION CASCADE BEGINS:
   a. Benefits Service attempts revert → FAILS (database connection timeout)
   b. Benefits Service retries 3 times → All fail
   c. Benefits Service publishes BenefitsCompensationFailed event
   d. Benefits Service enqueues manual review task

8. MANUAL REVIEW QUEUE:
   - Task created with priority: HIGH
   - Operations team notified via PagerDuty alert
   - Task includes: Member ID, SagaId, failed compensation step, error details
   - Operations team manually reverts benefits within 4 hours
   - Task marked complete
9. After manual compensation complete, remaining compensations proceed:
   a. Plan Service reverts to PlanA → Success
   b. Member Service reverts to PlanA → Success

10. Notification Service sends email: "Plan change encountered an issue. Our team resolved it, and your current plan (PlanA) remains active. We apologize for any confusion."
```

**Manual Review Queue Code**:

```csharp
public class BenefitsService
{
    public async Task OnCardGenerationFailed(CardGenerationFailedEvent evt)
    {
        _logger.LogWarning($"Saga {evt.SagaId}: Compensating benefits for member {evt.MemberId}");

        for (int attempt = 1; attempt <= 3; attempt++)
        {
            try
            {
                // Attempt to revert benefits
                await _benefitsRepository.RevertBenefitsAsync(evt.MemberId, evt.SagaId);

                // Success - publish compensation complete event
                var compensatedEvent = new BenefitsRevertedEvent
                {
                    SagaId = evt.SagaId,
                    MemberId = evt.MemberId,
                    Timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow
                };

                await _eventPublisher.PublishAsync("plan-change", compensatedEvent);

                _logger.LogInformation($"Saga {evt.SagaId}: Benefits compensation completed on attempt {attempt}");
                return; // Success
            }
            catch (Exception ex)
            {
                _logger.LogError(ex, $"Saga {evt.SagaId}: Benefits compensation attempt {attempt} failed");

                if (attempt == 3)
                {
                    // All retries exhausted - enqueue for manual review
                    var manualTask = new ManualReviewTask
                    {
                        TaskId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString(),
                        SagaId = evt.SagaId,
                        MemberId = evt.MemberId,
                        TaskType = "BenefitsCompensation",
                        Priority = ManualReviewPriority.High,
                        Description = $"Failed to compensate benefits after 3 attempts. Member: {evt.MemberId}, Saga: {evt.SagaId}",
                        ErrorDetails = ex.Message,
                        CreatedAt = DateTime.UtcNow,
                        DueBy = DateTime.UtcNow.AddHours(4) // 4-hour SLA
                    };

                    await _manualReviewQueue.EnqueueAsync(manualTask);

                    // Alert operations team
                    await _alertService.SendPagerDutyAlert(
                        "Benefits compensation failed after 3 retries",
                        $"Saga {evt.SagaId} requires manual intervention for member {evt.MemberId}");

                    // Publish compensation failure event
                    var failedEvent = new BenefitsCompensationFailedEvent
                    {
                        SagaId = evt.SagaId,
                        MemberId = evt.MemberId,
                        Reason = ex.Message,
                        ManualTaskId = manualTask.TaskId,
                        Timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow
                    };

                    await _eventPublisher.PublishAsync("plan-change", failedEvent);

                    _logger.LogCritical($"Saga {evt.SagaId}: Benefits compensation enqueued for manual review. Task: {manualTask.TaskId}");
                }
                else
                {
                    // Wait before retry (exponential backoff)
                    await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Pow(2, attempt)));
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```
